# Cloudflare Pages _redirects matches PATHS ONLY. It cannot match on hostname,
# so www -> apex cannot be done from this file. An earlier version had:
#
#   https://www.coolturkey.org/* https://coolturkey.org/:splat 301
#
# which looks right and silently never fires.
#
# www.coolturkey.org is attached to this project as a custom domain, so it
# serves the site rather than 522-ing. Making it 301 to the apex needs a
# zone-level Redirect Rule in the Cloudflare dashboard. See GO-LIVE.md.
#
# Until that rule exists, the duplicate is handled by the canonical tag on
# every page, which points at the apex.
